ples, tape, tacks or glue to hold carpet in place.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2839","label":"Take measurements and study floor sketches to calculate the area to be carpeted and the amount of material needed.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2840","label":"Cut carpet padding to size and install padding, following prescribed method.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2841","label":"Install carpet on some floors using adhesive, following prescribed method.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2842","label":"Nail tack strips around area to be carpeted or use old strips to attach edges of new carpet.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2843","label":"Fasten metal treads across door openings or where carpet meets flooring to hold carpet in place.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2845","label":"Draw building diagrams and record dimensions.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2846","label":"Move furniture from area to be carpeted and remove old carpet and padding.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2844","label":"Measure, cut and install tackless strips along the baseboard or wall.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"},{"id":"tsk:2847","label":"Cut and bind material.","ai_mode":"none","as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_task"}],"signals":[{"kind":"ai_obs","period":"latest","value":0.0,"as_of":"2026-10-22","src":"aei_obs"},{"kind":"ai_tier","period":"latest","value":"low","as_of":"2026-08","src":"bls_ai"}],"targets":[{"occ":{"id":"occ:47-2044.00","label":"Tile and Stone Setters","soc":"47-2044.00","job_zone":2,"ratings":{"newest":"2023-08","oldest":"2023-08"},"as_of":"2026-08","src":"onet"},"via":["close_to"],"needs":[{"id":"tec:microsoft-excel","label":"Microsoft Excel","kind":"technology","w